  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7caf0616-fcfd-48ce-8d8b-f6457d45605e"],
 " checks the whole literal object."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"8dd3ad4a-a43c-4de9-af36-276d6ff187ad"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "For an Experimental construction, the total graph is computed from the \
model. Materializing it with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraFiberedGraph"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraFiberedGraph", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "eee1a055-2465-4c79-86fe-a5b8a21ef84a"],
 " avoids repeating that construction."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"87a661d1-7d30-4962-b13f-9ff669e105ba"],

Cell[TextData[{
